.TH ZERODDS-ADMIN 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-admin \- ZeroDDS administration CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-admin
.I subcommand
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect topics, set QoS, query stats and orchestrate bridge daemons.
Talks to the inspect-endpoint of running daemons over UDS or TCP.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B topics list
List all known DDS topics, with type, partition, sample-count.
.TP
.B topics show \fITOPIC\fR
Pretty-print the live SampleInfo + last 16 samples.
.TP
.B qos set \fIENTITY\fR \fIQOS_FILE.xml\fR
Override QoS at runtime (subject to ImmutableQoS rules).
.TP
.B bridges status
Report each registered bridge daemon, its uptime, route count, last error.
.TP
.B reload \fIBRIDGE\fR
Send SIGHUP to the named bridge.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-spy (1),
.BR zerodds-monitor (1),
.BR zerodds-snitch (1).
